### Get reminder history with pagination
GET http://localhost:8030/reminder/history?page=0&size=10
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "TAKEN",
  "startDate": "2025-11-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2025-11-30T23:59:59Z"
}

###

### Get all reminders (no filters)
GET http://localhost:8030/reminder/history?page=0&size=20
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}

###

### Get missed reminders only
GET http://localhost:8030/reminder/history?page=0&size=10
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "MISSED",
  "startDate": "2025-11-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2025-11-28T23:59:59Z"
}

###

